    "detailed_description": "A shooting game in which the player defends the city while defeating ghosts summoned by a ritual performed by children as a test of courage, using a gun that can purify ghosts.<br />\r\nThe player becomes a girl (Ghost Shooter) with a gun that can purify ghosts, and fights to the death against ghosts and monsters that are approaching the city.<br />\r\nPlayers will challenge three modes: Story, Endless, and Defense Mode to discover the hidden secrets of the ghosts.<br />\r\nThe fate of the city is in the hands of one girl. ......What is the ending that awaits you in the end?",
